":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:199"},{"pos":11,"ar":"غَفُورٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūrun","verse_key":"2:199"},{"pos":12,"ar":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīmun","verse_key":"2:199"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١٩٩","en_gloss":"(199)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:199"}]},{"verse_key":"2:200","surah":2,"ayah":200,"ar_uthmani":"فَإِذَا قَضَيْتُم مَّنَـٰسِكَكُمْ فَٱذْكُرُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ كَذِكْرِكُمْ ءَابَآءَكُمْ أَوْ أَشَدَّ ذِكْرًا ۗ فَمِنَ ٱلنَّاسِ مَن يَقُولُ رَبَّنَآ ءَاتِنَا فِى ٱلدُّنْيَا وَمَا لَهُۥ فِى ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ مِنْ خَلَـٰقٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When you have completed your rites, remember God as much as you remember your own fathers, or even more. There are some who pray, ‘Our Lord, give us good in this world,’ and they will have no share in the Hereafter;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"Then when","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"2:200"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَضَيْتُم","en_gloss":"you complete[d]","transliteration":"qaḍaytum","verse_key":"2:200"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَّنَـٰسِكَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your acts of worship","transliteration":"manāsikakum","verse_key":"2:200"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَٱذْكُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"then remember","transliteration":"fa-udh'kurū","verse_key":"2:200"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:200"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كَذِكْرِكُمْ","en_gloss":"as you remember","transliteration":"kadhik'rikum","verse_key":"2:200"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ءَابَآءَكُمْ","en_gloss":"your forefathers","transliteration":"ābāakum","verse_key":"2:200"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"2:200"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَشَدَّ","en_gloss":"(with) greater","transliteration":"ashadda","verse_key":"2:200"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ذِكْرًۭا ۗ","en_gloss":"remembrance","transliteration":"dhik'ran","verse_key":"2:200"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَمِنَ","en_gloss":"And from","transliteration":"famina","verse_key":"2:200"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_